{"id":33608811238,"name":"Test","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAH0z3C5g","head_branch":"fix/DHIS2-22059-datavalueaudit-trigger-ownership","head_sha":"07c6635bf620015172d35da7da0b36e749634c3e","path":".github/workflows/run-tests.yml","run_number":56012,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"fix: make datavalue audit trigger migration robust to function-owner mismatch","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":10954,"check_suite_id":91072993517,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAVNF-Y7Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33608811238","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33608811238","created_at":"2026-09-02T08:27:33Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T08:36:32Z","run_started_at":"2026-09-02T08:27:33Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33608811238/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33608811238/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/91072993517","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33608811238/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33608811238/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33608811238/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: rewrite V2_44_23 trigger-function fix to be ownership-safe\n\nFolding the previous separate V2_44_24 migration back into V2_44_23 instead:\nFlywayConfig sets group=true, so all pending migrations run inside a single\ngrouped transaction. If V2_44_23 fails partway (at the ownership-dependent\nCREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION), the whole transaction rolls back before a later\nmigration like V2_44_24 ever executes - so a follow-up migration can never\nactually unblock an environment where V2_44_23 itself keeps failing.\n\nV2_44_23 now defines the corrected trigger logic under a new function name\n(log_datavalue_audit_v2) and repoints trg_datavalue_audit to it, instead of\nusing CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION on the pre-existing log_datavalue_audit()\nfrom V2_43_17. Retargeting a trigger only requires ownership of the table\n(datavalue), not of the function it calls, so this succeeds regardless of\nwho owns the old function. The old function is then best-effort dropped,\nsilently skipped if the current role doesn't own it.\n\nLive-validated against a local Postgres 14 instance by reproducing the\nexact ownership-mismatch scenario (table/sequence ownership normalized to\nthe migrating role, function ownership left on the original role): the\nunmodified V2_44_23 fails with \"must be owner of function\nlog_datavalue_audit\" as reported; the rewritten V2_44_23 applies cleanly in\na single transaction and the trigger fires correctly afterward.\n\n[DHIS2-22059]\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"07c6635bf620015172d35da7da0b36e749634c3e","tree_id":"ff3c11c1c13acb7e95a994870e7297f5fe06b08d","timestamp":"2026-09-02T08:27:07Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.